      "source": [
        "### Building a user profile\n",
        "A user profile is a weighted sum of the vectors of the items they rated. We weight by **rating minus the user's own average**, so a 1-star film pushes the profile *away* from its content and a 5-star film pulls it *toward* it. Then we score unseen items by cosine similarity to the profile."
      ],
      "id": "vuWrMvIzXEhN"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "WighZ71UXEhN",
        "outputId": "d65ba548-7777-427d-9549-3b48a52e6441"
      },
      "execution_count": 25,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Asha:\n",
            " Boundary Line     0.210\n",
            "Robot Uprising   -0.040\n",
            "Quantum Phone    -0.084\n",
            "dtype: float64\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "def user_profile(u):\n",
        "    r = R.loc[u].dropna()\n",
        "    w = r - r.mean()                                   # mean-centred weights\n",
        "    idx = [titles.index(m) for m in r.index]\n",
        "    return np.asarray(T[idx].T.dot(w.values)).ravel()\n",
        "\n",
        "def recommend_cb(u, n=3):\n",
        "    p = user_profile(u)\n",
        "    scores = pd.Series(cosine_similarity(p.reshape(1, -1), T).ravel(), index=titles)\n",
        "    return scores[R.loc[u].isna()].sort_values(ascending=False).head(n)   # unseen only\n",
        "\n",
        "print('Asha:\\n', recommend_cb('Asha'))\n"
      ],
      "id": "WighZ71UXEhN"
